cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Verdis in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Verdis: reproduce-first triage for security reports"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/usualdork/verdis"
url: "https://usualdork.github.io/verdis"
abstract: >-
  Verdis reproduces a security report before a human reads it. It extracts
  the claim, checks the project's policy and the duplicates, inspects the
  attachments, builds the target at the claimed ref, runs the proof of
  concept in a rootless sandbox with no network, and returns a verdict with
  a hashed evidence bundle. It ships as a Python command line tool and a
  GitHub Action.
keywords:
  - security
  - vulnerability triage
  - bug bounty
  - proof of concept
  - sandbox
  - evidence
authors:
  - family-names: Tripathy
    given-names: Manish
